", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KeithTheBat/", "num_games_owned": 236, "num_reviews": 142, "playtime_forever": 61323, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5958, "last_played": 1765632253, "avatar": "738daeb69a5426a8d9374fd776cebe93c9bfef77"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is fantastic, singleplayer is an awesome experience, & you can make some friends in the multiplayer experience.\nHowever buying the game mainly for the multiplayer experience, the community has quite a few bad apples, & a few bad apples can spoil it for everyone. I've had some experiences where people with power were irresponsible & handled multiplayer situations in their servers rather poorly. Considering this has happened on all the populated servers I have joined, I feel I can not recommend the game to my friends just for them to experience the same or similar problems I have ran into. However the game itself is not bad at all, despite the horrible engine it runs on, it's a fantastic experience & something worth playing.", "timestamp_created": 1485863158, "timestamp_updated": 1485863158, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54586559534072876", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 2, "count": 1}]}]}